This repository contains the visual identity of Calvary Temple TAG Arusha —
including the church mark, logotype, colour system, and photography — together
with the code that generates design tokens from it.

It is published for internal use by Calvary Temple and its contractors in
building and maintaining the church's own applications. No licence is granted
to any other party to use, reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works
from these assets, and in particular no permission is granted to use the church
mark or name to represent any other organisation.

Requests for any other use should be directed to the Calvary Temple church
office, Arusha.
